            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Employees who are absent more than thirty (30) regular working days during an anniversary year, or whose Leave of Absence continues from one anniversary year to another, shall have their anniversary date adjusted the number of workdays they were absent in excess of the thirty (30) regular working days; however, only one (1) thirty (30) day period shall be credited in adjusting the anniversary date during such an extended Leave of Absence.",
